---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import StudyPlate from "../components/StudyPlate.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="소개 · 우주개구리">
  <header class="section-head">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">ABOUT THE DEVELOPER</p>
      <h1 class="catalog-title">우주개구리</h1>
    </div>
  </header>
  <div class="profile">
    <div class="portrait">
      <StudyPlate kind="knot" label="OOZOOFROG" />
    </div>
    <section>
      <h2>oozoofrog</h2>
      <p>
        Swift로 iOS와 macOS 앱, 개발 도구를 만듭니다. 앱을 쓰는 사람과 만드는
        사람의 경험을 함께 고민합니다.
      </p>
      <dl>
        <dt>언어</dt>
        <dd>Swift, Objective-C</dd>
        <dt>프레임워크</dt>
        <dd>SwiftUI, UIKit, Combine, HealthKit, WatchKit</dd>
        <dt>관심 분야</dt>
        <dd>앱 아키텍처, 개발 도구, 오픈 소스</dd>
      </dl>
      <h3>연락처</h3>
      <p>
        <a href="https://github.com/oozoofrog">GitHub ↗</a> ·{" "}
        <a href="mailto:oozoofrog@gmail.com">oozoofrog@gmail.com</a>
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  .profile {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(160px, 0.65fr) 1.35fr;
    gap: 32px;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .portrait {
    height: 230px;
  }
  h2 {
    font: 2.6rem var(--serif);
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
  }
  p {
    margin: 0.65rem 0 1rem;
  }
  dl {
    margin: 20px 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
    gap: 8px 16px;
  }
  dt {
    font-weight: 650;
  }
  dd {
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  a {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  @media (max-width: 620px) {
    .profile {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .portrait {
      height: 155px;
    }
  }
</style>
